WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.230
An even number can be put into pairs without leftovers; an odd number leaves one when

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.173
arranged in pairs.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:12.431
Is 80 even or odd? The answer is even. 80 can be split into equal groups of two.

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:18.431
A bag at a school fair contains 49 marbles. Could they be paired without a leftover?

00:00:18.431 --> 00:00:21.326
Choose the number type. Pause the video and think.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:27.548
A bag at a school fair contains 49 marbles. Could they be paired without a leftover?

00:00:27.548 --> 00:00:32.895
Choose the number type. The answer is odd. 49 cannot be split into equal groups of

00:00:32.895 --> 00:00:33.229
two.
